  function overlayTitle(m){return {noodle:'Catch food. Dodge chili bombs.',match:'Remember every dish. Find the pairs.',roadster:'Pick a lane and commit.',trailblazer:'Memorize the path.',ace:'Wait for the perfect window.',wok:'Flap through the lantern gates.',lantern:'Collect dumplings. Reach the gate.',teatoss:'Break the tea brick wall.',sugar:'Sprint the rooftops. Bounce off the stompers.',mooncake:'Stack mooncakes. Keep your balance.'}[m]}
  function overlayCopy(m){return {noodle:'Move the bowl under any falling food to fill the counter. Catch the target number to clear the level. Avoid red chili bombs: they cost a heart. Missed food is safe, and there is no recipe sequence. Each level adds a food catch and increases the fall speed.',match:'Flip over two cards at a time and memorize each dish. Pairs stay revealed; mismatches turn back. In Auto mode, match 6 tiles at Levels 1–4, 8 at 5–9, 10 at 10–14, 12 at 15–19, and 14 at Level 20. The preview gets a little shorter between ten-level milestones, then gains extra study time at each milestone.',roadster:'Switch lanes to collect glowing flavor tokens and avoid trucks. Clear each level by getting its token target before time runs out. Later levels increase speed, traffic, and the number of tokens needed.',trailblazer:'Study the numbered route, then tap those tiles in order after they hide. Every next tile must touch an edge. Routes grow in length and leave less time to enter them. Each ten-level milestone adds extra route-preview study time.',ace:'Time each chopstick strike to catch the golden arc on the dumpling platter. Clear the target before three misses; later levels narrow the timing window and speed up the chopsticks.',wok:'The bird flies forward automatically. Tap, click, or press Space to flap through the open spaces in the lantern gates. Time each flap to stay airborne and avoid the floor.',lantern:'Guide the dumpling snake across a smooth open platform. Collect every dumpling to open the far-edge gate, then steer through the glowing doorway to finish. Platform edges and your own tail cost a heart.',teatoss:'Slide the paddle left or right to bounce the ball into the wall of tea bricks. Break every brick, catch the ball before it falls, and use angled paddle hits to steer your shots.',sugar:'A full-screen, 22-roof climb through three AI-generated Chinese city scenes. Run fast, double-jump, collect snacks, and reach the gate. Stomper sides are safe; land on top to bounce. Only the crusher dropping from above can hurt you. Jump the floor saw and roof spikes. Checkpoints save your climb every four roofs.',mooncake:'A timing-and-balance challenge in the Forbidden Bite bakery. Drop each moving mooncake layer onto the tower; the overhang trims away, so precise timing keeps the cake wide and steady. Stack the target to clear each round, and face a bakery boss every tenth level.'}[m]}
